This campaign shares a project with siblings attacking the same system. Coupling is kept explicit here
so no campaign silently changes a lever a sibling depends on (the failure mode: a forward-model bug
scored a decoder on wrong test data; see the project `CLAUDE.md` fork-and-archive rule).
