## Decision record (append-only — record, not contract)
Campaign-scoped decisions: why each non-obvious choice was made, the alternatives considered, the
conditions it rests on, and the trigger that would reopen it (`record-decision` writes here; skip the
obvious). The source-authority ledger from setup seeds the first entries — one per load-bearing fact
resolved from a source, with its value, the artifact it is PINNED to, its provenance tag
(PINNED / REPORTED / INFERRED / RECALLED, or REASONED), and the lower-authority sources quarantined and
why. Append-only: never rewrite a closed entry; supersede it and link the two. A decision that outlives
this campaign is promoted to `../../PROJECT.md` §Durable decisions. A metric epoch needs no entry here:
its record is the `campaign.metric_epochs` entry, the verdict it cites, the §The ONE metric diff, and
one line in the JOURNAL's §Where we stand.

